+## Coupled-status ownership
+
+`src/coupled_status.rs` owns the read-only projection of native coupled-run records. It reads `iterations.json` and durable `state/tui-work.json` ledgers without changing persistence, invoking providers, or running recorded tools. Request counts come only from durable ledger requests: wire usage counts every request, while task usage follows the native task charge default. Pending interrupted usage remains nullable when its ledger is absent; it is never represented as zero. The command's completion status is a recorded manifest state and is not independent verification or promotion authorization.
